 r←Test_DirSelect_001(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;result
⍝ Exercise the "DirSelect" method with defaults parameters only.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.DirSelect.Create''
 ⎕DL 0.1
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠n.Tree.SelItems⍳1

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 6 ⋄ n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap
